WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.870
In the “Personal” profile, the work intranet's address is pasted into the bar.

2
00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:03.896
A rule sends that site to the “Work” profile.

3
00:00:03.896 --> 00:00:09.196
The link opens in the “Work” window, and the band says the rule did it.
